memory loginHandler heap auto
async loginHandler no
purpose loginHandler "POST /api/auth/login — verify credentials via bcrypt.verifyPassword + mint a new session. On any failure (unknown user, wrong password, malformed body) return the SAME 401 with a generic message so an attacker cannot distinguish 'no such user' from 'bad password' by status or response shape."
invariant loginHandler "Unknown-user, wrong-password, and malformed-body failures all return the same 401 JSON response shape. Timing equalization is a follow-up hardening task; the session row is INSERT'd only on a real password match."

